    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kalnazar is a massively multiplayer online game. Play as adventurers and explore the new world, or become a gladiator and fight other players in arenas or battlefields.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a new world</strong>: A story with missions to complete alone or with others. Dungeons to clear with a group (5 players) to collect equipment, with multiple difficulty levels. You can also participate in raids with a group (10 players) to eradicate the greatest threats in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show your worth</strong>: Competitive arenas with a ranking system and unique rewards every 6 months. Arenas with various formats: 1v1, 2v2, 3v3. You can also let loose with others in battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple classes and races available</strong>: In this world, you can play as various classes: Warrior, Priest, Mage, Inquisitor, Rogue, Demon, through several races: Human, Sun Elf, Demon, Night Elf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventurer or Gladiator</strong>: When creating your character, you can choose to be an adventurer who can do everything, but you'll start at level 1, or you can choose to be a gladiator. You'll start at the maximum level with all skills unlocked, but this character can only participate in player-versus-player combat and cannot leave their city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world in evolution</strong>: There will be regular updates to balance and add content to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kalnazar is a massively multiplayer online game. Play as adventurers and explore the new world, or become a gladiator and fight other players in arenas or battlefields.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a new world</strong>: A story with missions to complete alone or with others. Dungeons to clear with a group (5 players) to collect equipment, with multiple difficulty levels. You can also participate in raids with a group (10 players) to eradicate the greatest threats in this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Show your worth</strong>: Competitive arenas with a ranking system and unique rewards every 6 months. Arenas with various formats: 1v1, 2v2, 3v3. You can also let loose with others in battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple classes and races available</strong>: In this world, you can play as various classes: Warrior, Priest, Mage, Inquisitor, Rogue, Demon, through several races: Human, Sun Elf, Demon, Night Elf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventurer or Gladiator</strong>: When creating your character, you can choose to be an adventurer who can do everything, but you'll start at level 1, or you can choose to be a gladiator. You'll start at the maximum level with all skills unlocked, but this character can only participate in player-versus-player combat and cannot leave their city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A world in evolution</strong>: There will be regular updates to balance and add content to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
